# Cleric — a Weak enemy of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 1/12 Weak enemies — 10 life, bribe 40 gold
# enemy: Cleric (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0211.dck "Cleric (W, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink 3 file
#   dated 2016-02-15; its first 13 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 14 lines (60 cards)
#   after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its .vNone/.v<Colour>
#   sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/cleric.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 1) [Tier
#   3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/cleric.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Weak) — "Cleric" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# cross-check: a screenshot of the 1997 .DCK file is on the wiki (files.mtg.wiki Cleric_dck_screen.jpg)
# group: 1997 originals
name: Cleric
21 Plains
4 Swords to Plowshares
3 Disenchant
4 Holy Strength
3 Holy Armor
3 Meekstone
4 Benalish Hero
4 Mesa Pegasus
2 Samite Healer
2 Savannah Lions
4 Amrou Kithkin
2 Pikemen
4 Tawnos's Weaponry
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Disenchant
#   .vBlack  2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Karma
#   .vBlue   2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Disenchant
#   .vGreen  2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Disenchant
#   .vRed    2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Conversion
#   .vWhite  2 Swords to Plowshares, 1 Disenchant
SB: 1 Karma
SB: 1 Conversion
